🔑 Key Framework Features Used:
UNet: The "Gold Standard" for medical segmentation.
Orientationd: Fixes "flipped" images automatically using NIfTI headers.
ScaleIntensityRanged: Essential for CT scans to highlight soft tissue (spleen) while ignoring bone/air.
